            "review_text": "eoleSuisse\nSuisse106 contributions\n0\nVery good.\nJan 2024 • Couples\nVery good little Vietnamese restaurant. Local cuisine.\n\nWe hesitated between 4 and 5 stars. We give one star as encouragement.\n\nThe boss speaks English.\n\n Unbeatable price quality. We recommend.\n\nOn the other hand, don't go doing your laundry nearby. Certainly very cheap but the clothes are placed pell-mell in a plastic bag to the point that they come out completely wrinkled. Damage. Taking two more minutes to fold would have been greatly appreciated.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 10, 2024",
