            "review_text": "KennyMarkJr\nLouisville, Kentucky4 contributions\n1\nThe must-go restaurant in Danang\nNov 2022\nReally good food and drinks! The manager came out and explained how to eat each meal which was absolutely great. Mr. Son was so nice and friendly, also reaching us how to pronounce meals correctly! All of the staff were very attentive, delicious vietnamese food. I like Pho the most. What a great lunch, will come back in the next time!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 18, 2022\nBình Trần\nWarm greetings from SC Restaurant & Bar.\n\nWe appreciate the time you have taken to post a review about your exquisite dining experiences at SC Restaurant & Bar. I am so glad to read you enjoyed your time with us. Your feedback will be shared with the entire restaurant team, as it acts as an inspiration and motivation for us to thrive harder to exceed our guests’ expectations. Thank you for choosing us, and we hope to have the pleasure of welcoming you again in the not-too-distant future.\nKindly Regards,\nRestaurant Manager\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
