            "review_title": "Review at SC Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "Mario Berg\nHamburg, Germany8 contributions\n3\nNice place to have breakfast in Danang\nOct 2022\nI came to Danang again, and everything was just perfect. I have some places to make a food tour on that trip, and this place is the ideal point to have breakfast with your partners. Vietnamese coffee is so fragrant and tasty, it made my day energetic to enjoy the trip. Highly recommend!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 10, 2022\nBình Trần\nDear Worldofmario,\n\nWarm greetings from SC Restaurant & Bar.\n\nWe appreciate the time you have taken to post a review about your exquisite dining experiences at SC Restaurant & Bar. I am so glad to read you enjoyed your time with us and our coffee.\nThank you again for your review and we look forward to welcoming you back to Danang.\nKindly Regards,\nRestaurant Manager\nRead more\nWritten November 14, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
