            "review_text": "Eilidh M\n7 contributions\n2\nAwesome experience!\nFeb 2020\nThis is a place you must visit! The Pho cocktail made with local ingredients was absolutely delicious! Great for before or after your visit to hike the Marble Mountains. The spring rolls were also very delicious! Our server Son Le went above and beyond for us. He was so hospitable. Helped me relocate my phone from a grab car and arranged for the driver to deliver it back to the restaurant. Such a great experience and a must for your trip to Da Nang! Highly recommend!!\nRead more\nWritten February 9, 2020\nSC Restaurant & Bar\nThank you so much! I hope see you a gain soon\nHave a good trip\nWritten February 10, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
